y"}, {"key": "C", "text": "easiness"}, {"key": "D", "text": "easier"}]}]}, {"id": 3, "name": "PART 3: FUNCTIONAL LANGUAGE & SHORT NOTICES (10 CÂU)", "questions": [{"id": 41, "part": 3, "partName": "PART 3: FUNCTIONAL LANGUAGE & SHORT NOTICES (10 CÂU)", "context": "Making an invitation.", "question": "Tom: \"Would you like to come to my house for movie night this Saturday?\"", "options": [{"key": "A", "text": "Yes, I'd love to! Thanks."}, {"key": "B", "text": "No, I don't know movie."}, {"key": "C", "text": "I am 10 years old."}, {"key": "D", "text": "The cinema is big."}]}, {"id": 42, "part": 3, "partName": "PART 3: FUNCTIONAL LANGUAGE & SHORT NOTICES (10 CÂU)", "context": "Short notice on a science classroom door.", "question": "NOTICE: \"Please wash your hands before entering the science laboratory.\"", "options": [{"key": "A", "text": "Wash hands after leaving the lab."}, {"key": "B", "text": "Clean hands before going inside the lab."}, {"key": "C", "text": "Do not touch anything in the lab."}, {"key": "D", "text": "Bring water into the lab."}]}, {"id": 43, "part": 3, "partName": "PART 3: FUNCTIONAL LANGUAGE & SHORT NOTICES (10 CÂU)", "context": "Offering help to an elderly person.", "question": "An: \"May I carry these heavy groceries for you, Mrs. Brown?\"", "options": [{"key": "A", "text": "That's very kind of you, thank you!"}, {"key": "B", "text": "You're welcome!"}, {"key": "C", "text": "I am fine, and you?"}, {"key": "D", "text": "No, I am Mrs. Brown."}]}, {"id": 44, "part": 3, "partName": "PART 3: FUNCTIONAL LANGUAGE & SHORT NOTICES (10 CÂU)", "context": "Notice on a swimming pool wall.", "question": "SAFETY RULE: \"No running or pushing on the pool deck!\"", "options": [{"key": "A", "text": "Swimming in the deep water."}, {"key": "B", "text": "Running around the pool edge."}, {"key": "C", "text": "Wearing a swimsuit."}, {"key": "D", "text": "Jumping into the water."}]}, {"id": 45, "part": 3, "partName": "PART 3: FUNCTIONAL LANGUAGE & SHORT NOTICES (10 CÂU)", "context": "Asking for directions.", "question": "Tourist: \"Excuse me, could you tell me how to get to the nearest bus station?\"", "options": [{"key": "A", "text": "Go straight ahead for two blocks, then turn left."}, {"key": "B", "text": "Yes, the bus is red."}, {"key": "C", "text": "I like travelling by bus."}, {"key": "D", "text": "The station is very far from here yesterday."}]}, {"id": 46, "part": 3, "partName": "PART 3: FUNCTIONAL LANGUAGE & SHORT NOTICES (10 CÂU)", "context": "Responding to an apology.", "question": "Minh: \"I'm really sorry for losing your favorite blue pen!\"", "options": [{"key": "A", "text": "Don't worry about it. I have another one."}, {"key": "B", "text": "Yes, you are right."}, {"key": "C", "text": "It is on the table."}, {"key": "D", "text": "Thank you very much."}]}, {"id": 47, "part": 3, "partName": "PART 3: FUNCTIONAL LANGUAGE & SHORT NOTICES (10 CÂU)", "context": "Notice on a park bench.", "question": "WET PAINT! \"Do not sit down.\"", "options": [{"key": "A", "text": "Sit on the bench carefully."}, {"key": "B", "text": "Avoid sitting on the bench."}, {"key": "C", "text": "Paint the bench green."}, {"key": "D", "text": "Wash the bench with water."}]}, {"id": 48, "part": 3, "partName": "PART 3: FUNCTIONAL LANGUAGE & SHORT NOTICES (10 CÂU)", "context": "Asking for opinion.", "question": "Lan: \"What do you think about our new English teacher?\"", "options": [{"key": "A", "text": "She is very patient and explains lessons clearly."}, {"key": "B", "text": "She goes home by motorbike."}, {"key": "C", "text": "English is my favorite subject."}, {"key": "D", "text": "Yes, she is a teacher."}]}, {"id": 49, "part": 3, "partName": "PART 3: FUNCTIONAL LANGUAGE & SHORT NOTICES (10 CÂU)", "context": "Short email notice.", "question": "\"Dear Students, the History museum field trip is moved from Friday to next Monday due to heavy rain.\"", "options": [{"key": "A", "text": "The museum was closed on Monday."}, {"key": "B", "text": "Because 